{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"prompts":{"listChanged":true},"tools":{"listChanged":true}},"serverInfo":{"name":"cloud-business-organiser-mcp","version":"1.2.0","title":"CBO MCP by usefulapi","websiteUrl":"https://usefulapi.io/cloud-business-organiser/","icons":[{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}]},"instructions":"Tools for CBO, hosted by usefulapi.io. If the user is new or asks what this server can do, suggest requests such as: \"Which invoices are still unpaid, and which clients owe them?\"; \"Show me all sales orders from last week.\"; \"List our supplier invoices issued in October.\". Read-only tools never change data; ask the user before a tool that creates, changes or deletes CBO data. Free plan: 50 tool calls per month. Run cbo_usage_status to see the calls used this month. If the user asks for something none of these tools can do, tell the user and, with their OK, run cbo_request_feature to record the request. Paid plans: Pro (10,000 tool calls a month, $9/month or $90/year, for normal use) and Pro+ (100,000 tool calls a month, $39/month or $390/year, for automations and heavy use). A plan can be cancelled at any time and then runs to the end of the paid period, so it also suits a one-time job. When the user wants more calls or reaches the limit, run cbo_upgrade without a plan: it returns both plans, each with a payment link for the user to open. cbo_cancel_subscription cancels Pro at the end of the paid period.","tools":[{"name":"cbo_list_clients","title":"List clients","description":"List the company's clients (customers). GET /clients.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"search":{"description":"Free-text search.","type":"string"},"search_fields":{"description":"Comma-separated fields to search in (see the 